---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Road to LA28">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-medium">Road to LA28</h1>
  <p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl text-sky">Cricket returns to the Olympics in 2028, last seen at the Games in 1900.</p>
  <div class="mt-6 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-3">
    <div class="rounded-2xl bg-blue p-4"><p class="text-xl font-medium">T20</p><p class="text-sm opacity-85">Six teams per gender</p></div>
    <div class="rounded-2xl bg-green p-4"><p class="text-xl font-medium">Pomona, CA</p><p class="text-sm opacity-85">Venue</p></div>
    <div class="rounded-2xl bg-coral p-4"><p class="text-xl font-medium">Jul 14-30, 2028</p><p class="text-sm opacity-85">Games dates</p></div>
  </div>
  <h2 class="mt-8 text-lg font-medium">Can I play for Team USA?</h2>
  <p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl text-sky">Olympic teams require US citizenship. International cricket under the ICC uses residency rules instead (three years). The USA Cricket youth pathway is still being built, so check usacricket.org for the latest.</p>
</BaseLayout>
